  "visual_review": [
    "Fall identities compared with original boss sprite first frames; original nonhumanoid forms retained where descriptions differ.",
    "No dead bosses, blood or violent wounds; exhaustion, drooping poses and easing curse light convey defeat.",
    "Ruby remains original round jam-spirit mascot, apron/book/gem intact; no transformation.",
    "Fall/onward bottom quarter kept free of actors; runtime dialogue not baked into art.",
    "Freed forms checked as full cutouts, no background or text; boss05 intentionally remains a small seed, not a person."
  ],
